                "question": "How do I start a return or exchange?",
                "answer": "<ul><li>Go to our returns portal and enter your order number and email address.</li><li>Select the item you would like to return or exchange and choose a reason.</li><li>Select your preferred option, either a refund, store credit, or an exchange.</li><li>You will receive a return label.</li><li>Simply drop off your parcel at a nearby collection point.</li></ul>",
