              "settings": {
                "question": "How does exchanging with store credit work?",
                "answer": "<p>If you would like to exchange your item for a different style or colour, we recommend choosing store credit in our returns portal instead of the standard exchange option. This gives you more flexibility and ensures a faster process.</p><p>Simply register your item for store credit. Once your return has been processed, you will receive store credit for the full value of your item as well as the return shipping costs. You can then immediately place a new order for your preferred style or colour.</p><p>This way, you avoid waiting for stock availability and benefit from a smooth and flexible exchange experience.</p>",
