                "answer": "<p>Returns from outside the EU (except the UK) are shipped under Delivery Duties Unpaid (DDU). This means all customs charges, taxes, and duties are your responsibility.<br/><br/>We can’t reimburse or estimate these costs, please check with your local customs office for more information.<br/><br/></p>",
